    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font-size: 10pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><I>Others.
    </I>Other revenue decreased by US$0.4 million from US$1.5 million for the six months ended June 30, 2023, to US$1.1 million for the
    six months ended June 30, 2024. The decrease in other income was primarily attributable to a decrease of US$0.5 million in insurance
    brokerage business as the Company disposed of this business in the first half of 2024.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

