in Lion&rsquo;s periodic filings with the SEC, including Lion&rsquo;s Annual Report on Form 20-F for the fiscal year ended December 31,
2023. Lion&rsquo;s SEC filings are available publicly on the SEC&rsquo;s website at www.sec.gov.</FONT></P>

